WEBVTT

00:00:02.010 --> 00:00:05.350
On Earth, when you call the dragon, all kinds of crazy stuff happens.

00:00:05.570 --> 00:00:07.770
The sky turns completely black.

00:00:11.520 --> 00:00:13.520
Waking me from my slumber.

00:00:13.640 --> 00:00:14.800
Look at that thing!

00:00:14.940 --> 00:00:16.680
I've never felt a power like this one.

00:00:17.310 --> 00:00:19.130
What are you?

00:00:19.290 --> 00:00:22.190
Ally to God! Nightmare to you!

00:00:25.870 --> 00:00:26.820
I will be done.

00:00:30.890 --> 00:00:33.870
On the last episode of Dragon Ball Z,

00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:38.020
Frieza's evil plan to dominate the universe finally fell apart.

00:00:38.340 --> 00:00:39.720
And so did Frieza.

00:00:41.050 --> 00:00:43.770
With the planet Namek teetering on the edge of destruction,

00:00:44.170 --> 00:00:46.690
it was time for Goku to bid Frieza farewell.

00:00:49.980 --> 00:00:50.240
Huh?

00:00:52.250 --> 00:00:56.910
The half of Frieza that Goku left behind obviously wasn't his better half.

00:00:58.080 --> 00:00:59.660
Unable to accept defeat,

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:03.260
The one-armed, legless villain bitterly gathered his energy

00:01:03.260 --> 00:01:07.080
for a last-ditch effort to nail Goku from behind.

00:01:11.650 --> 00:01:13.500
But enough was enough.

00:01:13.930 --> 00:01:16.410
Goku had already spared Frieza's life twice,

00:01:16.570 --> 00:01:18.670
and it was time to say goodnight

00:01:18.670 --> 00:01:22.050
to this shameless menace once and for all.

00:01:22.230 --> 00:01:29.690
So it happened that Frieza's reign of terror

00:01:30.220 --> 00:01:31.640
was ended for good.

00:02:23.360 --> 00:02:24.400
Got to know, please!

00:02:26.020 --> 00:02:27.580
Yeah, something has happened, Dan.

00:02:32.110 --> 00:02:34.290
The fight is over. Frieza is dead.

00:02:36.220 --> 00:02:41.040
Frieza was pleading for his life to Goku, so Goku tried to help him out.

00:02:41.840 --> 00:02:47.020
He gave Frieza some of his own power, but instead of using the power to escape,

00:02:47.520 --> 00:02:50.560
Frieza turned on Goku and used it to attack him.

00:02:51.440 --> 00:02:53.160
Man, what a jerk.

00:02:53.320 --> 00:02:58.260
Indeed. So Goku was forced to deliver the final blow to put her end to the fight for good.

00:02:58.600 --> 00:02:59.980
All right, you're saying...

00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:01.140
that Goku won, right?

00:03:02.350 --> 00:03:05.510
Yes, after Goku transformed into a Super Saiyan,

00:03:05.810 --> 00:03:08.610
Frieza found himself totally outclassed.

00:03:08.630 --> 00:03:09.030
Yes!

00:03:11.480 --> 00:03:14.600
Gosh, that means that Goku

00:03:14.600 --> 00:03:16.320
is the strongest fighter in the universe.

00:03:16.900 --> 00:03:18.200
Hmph, what do you know?

00:03:18.470 --> 00:03:19.990
And right from our own backyard,

00:03:20.350 --> 00:03:22.310
I wouldn't mind a little sparring session

00:03:22.310 --> 00:03:23.910
just to see how I measure up.

00:03:30.090 --> 00:03:31.590
Freezer, but he didn't win.

00:03:31.950 --> 00:03:34.030
As a matter of fact, he just might lose.

00:03:34.270 --> 00:03:35.310
Lose? But how?

00:03:36.090 --> 00:03:38.670
By still being on Namek when it explodes.

00:03:38.910 --> 00:03:39.610
That's how.

00:03:40.760 --> 00:03:43.220
He doesn't have enough time.

00:03:43.260 --> 00:03:46.440
He's heading to Freezer's spaceship because it's closer than his.

00:03:47.060 --> 00:03:49.080
But Namek could blow any second now.

00:03:49.280 --> 00:03:51.600
The surface looks like boiling spaghetti sauce.

00:03:51.900 --> 00:03:54.520
It would take a miracle to get him out in time.

00:03:55.160 --> 00:03:56.900
